{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8871e893d175640811580763681bb2e588e6a5e5be7e4f999b8484f9de98fe42", "ja": "Bonus Track　きっと明日も", "zh": "Bonus Track　明天也一定", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3a6227fb76cfb904e11ede6ab7bcc1bd723c336229dd109e373af873fa5793c6", "ja": "初ライブを終え、今度は社長達のバンドと対\nバンライブをする事に。待機中、ふと終わり\nを感じて涙ぐむ恵美に、また機会はあると言\nうプロデューサー。成り行きで集まったメン\nバーだが、今は確かな絆を感じていた……。", "zh": "结束首次演出后，接下来要和社长他们的乐队进行对盘演出。等待期间，惠美忽然感受到一切即将结束，不禁眼含泪水，制作人便告诉她以后还会有机会。虽然成员们是顺其自然聚集到一起的，但如今已经感受到了真切的羁绊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "1e4cf40e87640c7a605b983179d9ff8a84fe52cf1d2b670c81c4196bc602144e", "ja": "それじゃあお前ら、次が最後の曲だー！", "zh": "那么各位，接下来是最后一首歌——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "9140c598fb52a5dade24a71d5f9d5c79d8307ede07bfc3778301d81727b178f3", "ja": "最後の最後まで、声を絞り出せ！\n聞いてくれ……『シャケナベイベ』！", "zh": "直到最后一刻，把嗓子喊破！\n听好了……《Shake It Baby》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1164eee2317d68034c16642441192edd2a862e698b9931b75a67395d2bd534f2", "ja": "（今日はここ、765プロライブ劇場にて、\n恵美達のバンドと……）", "zh": "（今天在这里，765号专业现场剧场，惠美她们的乐队和……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "12b0d0f4f81e36bc60f6be63a7c1c10124a32bfbd4fb2aadf05ba15a520dc0a0", "ja": "（新星の如く現れたハードコアロックバンド、\n『プレジデント・ジャム・イン』の対バンライブだ！）", "zh": "（一支如新星般横空出世的硬核摇滚乐队，『プレジデント・ジャム・イン』的对台演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3ce34147ef00dc04f876c28a5a0ee35a7e03dae97daefa7d43cf795cad2c83d9", "ja": "（お客さんは劇場のアイドルと関係者、完全に身内だけ\nのイベントだが、何故か盛り上がっている……！）", "zh": "（观众是剧场的偶像和相关人员，完全是内部活动，但不知为何气氛却十分热烈……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "cde162b5da6c0e32211d33f7448810144500b588290814840084757228805b39", "ja": "社長、お疲れさまー！　社長がライブしてるとか\nなんか不思議だったけど、すごいカッコよかったよ♪", "zh": "社长，辛苦啦——！社长亲自上台表演，感觉还挺奇妙的，但真的超帅气哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1006_president", "source_sha256": "f67d11bb38ee5ae6615b4530bab4bd4a6a0ae2b9c0cf1a5fc5afffa44a2f472a", "ja": "うむ！　所君、感想をありがとう！", "zh": "嗯！所同学，谢谢你的感想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1007_president", "source_sha256": "d85512615232d02ade12d6e24a2a4add9686d4954e0d69f4d1ae011e77ee955a", "ja": "アイドル事務所の社長たるもの、\nやはりカッコよくあらねばならないからね。", "zh": "身为偶像事务所的社长，\n当然得保持帅气才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "49b0135124723d20963a895de1afb1f22dbdb53f40a13812ad7d9ee205355353", "ja": "最後の曲は、みんなノリノリでしたね♪\nプレジャムのオリジナル曲ですか？", "zh": "最后那首曲子，大家都嗨翻了呢♪\n是Pleasure Jam的原创曲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "348cf767a3109eeaeecfa365688a817172dfa1aab791daefb9d96b9c88b89a30", "ja": "えっ？\n可奈ちゃん、『シャケナベイベ』を知らないの？", "zh": "咦？\n可奈，你不知道《Shakena Baby》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "c18b50c540a54d6b9d3046b41fbeeb550e5e3280fb9fd43b125d688d622c74fc", "ja": "最後の曲はみんなで盛り上がれるよう、誰もが知ってる\nスーパーヒットソングをカバーしたんだけど……。", "zh": "最后一首曲子是为了让大家一起嗨起来，翻唱了一首人人都知道的超级热门歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "0a77d26c12077b667cfaf62cfbe36c9e671bef2c6ad2d376cb5a150efaa458c0", "ja": "私も、音無先輩に教わるまで知らなくて……\n聞いてみたら、とっても素敵な曲でした♪", "zh": "我也是听音无前辈讲了之后才知道的……听过之后，发现是首非常棒的歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "54db6e61780e4b9314f448b57814351dd54ed35dea922584ca0fc2b6f942629b", "ja": "ありさは『シャケナベイベ』、知ってましたよ！\n推しアイドルちゃんがカバーしてましたから♪", "zh": "亚利沙知道《Shake It Up Baby》哦！\n因为我推的小偶像曾经翻唱过呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "7a2615d8f4509333da48ca56c4d6d02053aea1f7ca110984fff8b9cda80da706", "ja": "あ、亜利沙ちゃん……！", "zh": "啊，亚利沙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d0fbb67c4fe00958ef913a9998e77e3a2eb964d2425f6f60b5e668c13df0b046", "ja": "恵美、亜利沙、可奈。そろそろ出番だから、\nステージ袖に移動しようか。", "zh": "恵美、亚利沙、可奈。差不多该轮到你们出场了，\n去舞台侧边候场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "85be95c5367b4169ba8b932cb3feca9262db6a124c281298e8b805af13c92496", "ja": "わぁ～、そうでした！\nつい、話し込んじゃってました！", "zh": "哇～对哦！\n不知不觉就聊得太投入了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "b1fd8761f2211269576c55fa71b12256506cfe8a3f594f9c5e7fafa9a04ccaf4", "ja": "3人は、今日が2回目のライブよね。デビューライブは\n見られなかったけど、楽しみにしてるわね！", "zh": "你们3个人，今天是第2次办演出吧。虽然没能看成\n出道演出，不过我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "ef4cf6254542d41b764249d4f29a335ef57ad0cc68504f6a59897f35d69d992b", "ja": "イコライザー、OK！　マスターボリューム、OK！\nありさ、準備完了です！", "zh": "均衡器，OK！主音量，OK！\n亚利沙，准备完毕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "42442c46dcec0319a223d94a3fae7e06fba87e589821a715729fd6ece291ae58", "ja": "アンプの音量はリハの時と同じ、と……。\n可奈もスタンバイOKでーす！", "zh": "功放的音量和排练时一样……。\n可奈也准备完毕啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "ac6f25687023d82e265fb343257a5b1dbdef65e04be6dbbbd15056a7c9ef9948", "ja": "恵美ちゃんは……へっ？", "zh": "惠美……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "71e785c7d9e8e2446bd68ba4ec534c483ecab1edc42113179bc4f4dec08ab5e9", "ja": "うう……ぐすっ。", "zh": "呜呜……抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "f8e22c6cc0e7df4414b3b5db07ee0df392d511462c919a97a64639db43bbc5c7", "ja": "め、恵美ちゃん、どうしたんですか！？\n何かトラブルですか？　それともどこか痛いとか？", "zh": "惠美，你、你这是怎么了！？\n出什么问题了吗？还是哪里疼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "db0d9777e5253e9baa4e5f117f50becb04ab0c9ecf75fbc297ea2cfe463053fc", "ja": "あっ……ごめんごめん、違うんだ～。\nほら、最近ずっと、ふたりと練習してたからさ。", "zh": "啊……对不起对不起，不是那样啦～  \n你看，最近一直都在和她们两个一起练习嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "6ad4c2ce022cea06bd663f908d1bfba996151f0e093e391ad28cb9ba8690c744", "ja": "今日のライブが終わったら、そういうのなくなるんだ\nな～って思ったら、なんかぶわーっと来ちゃって。", "zh": "一想到今天的演出结束后，这种时光就要没有了……不知怎么的，情绪一下子就涌上来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "418b964754c475da7e52fdecc1370cc91734b663bf110c9486ec5a9b299a4b3c", "ja": "大丈夫、何も今日で解散するってわけじゃないんだ。\nステージで披露する機会は、何度でもあるさ。", "zh": "没事的，又不是说今天就要解散。\n以后在舞台上表演的机会，要多少有多少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "d18763a1eeeef8ea000e0d1a8609d2e296a45ac8974f5d4b49e547060b44bd23", "ja": "{$P$}……うん、そうだね！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，说得也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "86cbab4c5efdc436ce4aca1bf1e648cad0f5821c432968e6c87cfff0155a7189", "ja": "恵美さん。私も、成り行きでメンバーになっちゃい\nましたけど……一緒にバンドできて、楽しかったです！", "zh": "恵美小姐。虽然我只是机缘巧合才加入进来\n……但能和大家一起组乐队，真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "17c9956b14264d96b757e04a60a3c81fc40ae134695646e1f2aa4dbd287bf14a", "ja": "ひとりでギターを弾いてるだけだったら、\nきっと、こんなにがんばれなかったから……。", "zh": "如果只是一个人弹吉他，\n我肯定也没办法这么努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "df2b14da8e8b072c09360be16124eb551a048197d6aac606dc8773256e8260ac", "ja": "ありさも、とっても楽しかったです！　ヒューマン\nビートボックスは、挫折しちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "亚利沙也觉得非常开心！虽然口技\n半途而废了就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "c74c14e033fe32a8130f9ab13ab144ffb85dc63e670054b61941b402e1409b5a", "ja": "恵美ちゃんと可奈ちゃんとバンド活動した日々は、\nありさの青春の1ページとして焼き付けますよ～っ！", "zh": "和惠美、可奈一起进行乐队活动的日子，我会将它铭刻为有里纱青春的第1页～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "9c0ac2e88dac7cdce0907686e4b0ff5b356054bb784ad023cf72a41bb7c1605a", "ja": "これからも、時々集まって、バンド練習しましょう！\nもっともっと、ギターの腕を磨いておくぞ～！　お～！", "zh": "今后也偶尔聚在一起练乐队吧！\n我会继续好好磨炼吉他的技术～！哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c013b00eea262e18b8d94ea8db4a02ba0d978e4d64752d8846a19bbf9a8aeb8d", "ja": "よし、みんな準備はできたみたいだな。\n場内SEのボリュームが上がったら、行くぞ？", "zh": "好，看来大家都准备齐了。\n场内音效音量变大之后，就上场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_07_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "5b467f55f1c967b15ed3044807134cad699696f62d023a53d27b1d70992f749b", "ja": "ん、そうだね！　社長たちに負けないように、\nアタシたちも、しっかり盛り上げないと！", "zh": "嗯，好！可不能输给社长他们，\n我们也要好好把气氛炒热才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
